      "Own reusable verifier semantics and runner recipes here; orchestration owns build/rehearsal YAML invoking them. Add just build-release-payload target (release CLI for the three supported native targets, release cdylib with pdk for wasm32-wasip1), verify-release-payload intent payload-directory, test-release-payload-verification, and test-release-wasm-payload payload sha256 recipes. Target and filenames are read from PM-004's intent; arguments select a declared slot, never introduce inventory.",
