      "Baseline: moon_wasm_sandbox.rs::resolve_wasm_file currently silently builds/stages target/wasm32-wasip1/debug/callisto_moon.wasm. Add an explicit release verification mode selected before process startup by CALLISTO_RELEASE_WASM_PATH and CALLISTO_RELEASE_WASM_SHA256. This mode verifies and stages only those supplied final release-profile bytes, checks the staged digest again, and never builds or falls back to debug. Configure sandbox discovery per subprocess (or explicit plugin path) using safe Rust, without adding unsafe environment mutation.",
      "Implement just test-release-wasm-payload payload sha256 to pass the explicit override into the EXISTING moon_wasm_sandbox integration target through the repository runner. Drive the real Moon/Extism register_extension, define_extension_config and execute_extension success/error contract cases against that exact file; retain ordinary developer sandbox mode separately. The native test harness profile need not be release: the supplied plugin bytes must be the manifest-bound release-profile payload.",
      "Add deliberate negatives in test-release-payload-verification.sh: unsigned or altered-after-signing macOS executable, x86_64 bytes in ARM64 slot and converse, dynamic Linux executable for each static slot, failing --version/wrong product version, malformed or wrong-target WASM, missing release WASM while a valid debug file exists, and substituted valid WASM bytes with a mismatching digest. The real sandbox must reject a valid WASM module missing the required Moon ABI; verifier negatives assert nonzero before attestation or artifact handoff.",
      "Run rtk just test-release-payload-verification on the relevant native runner matrix, rtk just test-release-wasm-payload <exact-final-release-wasm> <manifest-sha256>, and rtk just test. Expected: both Linux native smoke checks, extracted signed macOS validation, actual moon_wasm_sandbox protocol tests and every deliberate wrong-artifact negative execute; record unavailable native platforms as missing evidence rather than passing.",
      "Run rtk just fmt-check and rtk just lint. Orchestration must invoke the same verify-release-payload recipe in both production build and rehearsal before attestation/complete-manifest publication; full AC-005 certification additionally requires those actual job invocations."
    ],
    "commit_message": "test(release): verify exact final distribution payloads",
